1,"quote_count":55,"reply_count":113,"retweet_count":143},"text":"BREAKING NEWS🚨: NVIDIA has just achieved 423 tok/s/user 🚀 on the 2.8T Parameter Kimi K3 model via a new upstream vLLM optimization. 1.68x Faster on the Same Hardware!\n\nThis was done by NVIDIA CentML's Benjamin, who wrote NVIDIA's new decode-specialized kernels in Cute DSL via https://t.co/wuRH3z1bEu","url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2111627094878790023"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["7_2111596378220535809"]},"author_id":"1745106082790318080","created_at":"2026-10-17T23:13:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111596468528087078"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/dTTkpf6VHU","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2111596468528087078/video/1","media_key":"7_2111596378220535809","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/dTTkpf6VHU"}]},"id":"2111596468528087078","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":418,"impression_count":116323,"like_count":1029,"quote_count":24,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":91},"text":"GLM 5.3’s biggest leap came from post-training alone.\n\n“GLM 5.3 was built entirely by post-training the previous model. For me, that was a wake-up call.”\n\n“Post-training is far more GPU-efficient than pre-training from scratch. Plenty of companies can’t afford to train a model https://t.co/dTTkpf6VHU","url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2111596468528087078"},{"author_id":"2939913921","created_at":"2026-10-17T20:08:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111549984373911572"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/opencode/statu…","end":297,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/opencode/status/2111519637049319818","start":274,"url":"https://t.co/fkogyd8GKF"}]},"id":"2111549984373911572","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":52,"impression_count":25631,"like_count":308,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":41,"retweet_count":12},"text":"There's something very odd going on with \"distillation\" if a cyber attack to steal api keys is looped under the same term. Same goes with looping together the model transfer stations to China. It's not clear why the volume is so high and how it's related to model training. https://t.co/fkogyd8GKF","url":"https://x.com/natolambert/status/2111549984373911572"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111532830194819072"]},"author_id":"1745106082790318080","created_at":"2026-10-17T19:00:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111532833114054891"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":27,"id":"1774187564276289536","start":14,"username":"vllm_project"},{"end":41,"id":"1998160192903745536","start":32,"username":"inferact"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/jVevqcSNiG","end":237,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2111532833114054891/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111532830194819072","start":214,"url":"https://t.co/jVevqcSNiG"}]},"id":"2111532833114054891","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":46,"impression_count":28696,"like_count":189,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":15},"text":"TOKENMAXXING: @vllm_project and @inferact achieve 1.3 BILLION tokens per $ of TCO (hyperscaler volume pricing) via disaggregated serving on AgentX.\n\nThis result is 4x better than the B300 aggregated configuration. https://t.co/jVevqcSNiG","url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2111532833114054891"},{"author_id":"2939913921","created_at":"2026-10-17T14:48:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111469383872921628"],"id":"2111469383872921628","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":12636,"like_count":136,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":2},"text":"The bot replies are so out of control here, sucks","url":"https://x.com/natolambert/status/2111469383872921628"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111460952906358784"]},"author_id":"2939913921","created_at":"2026-10-17T14:15:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111461099140772137"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/H86QwoXI7h","end":275,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/natolambert/status/2111461099140772137/photo/1","media_key":"3_21114609529